      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The symptoms you're experiencing could be due to the volatile organic compounds (VOCs) released by the hydroponic system, particularly during the misting cycles. To minimize exposure, consider using a HEPA air purifier in your bedroom, which can filter out many airborne particles and VOCs. Positioning the purifier near your window to help draw in pollutants can also be effective. Additionally, opening a window for a short duration after the misting cycle, allowing fresh air to enter, might also help reduce VOC levels.",
